    "title": "Splurge Art AI Image Generator",
    "description": "Splurge Art is a powerful AI Art generator in the market. Our platform uniquely features a gamified social media platform where you can learn and have fun with other AI enthusiasts!  \r\n\r\nGenerate Stunning AI-Generated Images and Videos with Words.\r\n* Create images and videos in seconds \r\n* Explore new art styles by using public prompts of other users\r\n\r\nChoose from the Most Advanced & Latest Models, including\r\n* Dall-E 3 (OpenAI)\r\n* Midjourney\r\n* Stable Diffusion 3\r\n* ControlNet \r\n* Pika AI\r\n++ All Popular SDXL and Turbo Community Models\r\n\r\nJoin a vibrant AI Art Community\r\n* Learn from the prompts and styles of other users\r\n* Buy and collect artworks that pique your interest\r\n* View step-by-step procedure for creating the images you bought\r\n* Showcase your own AI creations to our growing community\r\n\r\nEarn Rewards from your Passion for AI Art\r\n* Compete with other users in fun contests and challenges\r\n* Sell your creations and earn coins each time these are traded\r\n\r\nOpen for Everyone\r\n* All core features are accessible and guest users are given limited credits per day\r\n* Basic users can additionally earn credits through various tasks and achievements\r\n\r\nThe Future of Art is for everyone!\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://splurge.art/privacy-policy\r\nTerms of Service: https://splurge.art/terms-of-service",
